---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & Working Principles | Kanishk Roy"
  description="Biography, background, and operational philosophy of Kanishk Roy — builder of digital products and AI-powered systems."
>
  <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 transition-colors">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[#3157FF] dark:text-[#6B82FF] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-bold mb-3">
        BIOGRAPHY &amp; PRINCIPLES
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold text-[#111111] dark:text-[#F5F5F2] tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-6">
        Building across technology and creative craft.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-[#6B6B6B] dark:text-[#A3A3A0] leading-relaxed">
        Based in Kolkata, India. Focused on real-time edge architecture, generative commercial production, and evidence-grounded AI intelligence.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Narrative & Quotes -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start mb-20">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#111111] dark:text-[#F5F5F2] leading-relaxed font-sans">
        <p>
          I operate as an independent product studio and technical lab. My work is anchored in a simple belief: the most compelling digital experiences are built by people who understand the entire stack — from edge WebSocket routing and database models to camera focal lengths, sound design, and micro-typography.
        </p>
        <p>
          Rather than producing theoretical specifications or hollow AI marketing concepts, I write the code, block the camera angles, train and constrain the generative models, and deploy the working infrastructure to production.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#6B6B6B] dark:text-[#A3A3A0]">
          When building software like RandomChat, the priority is zero-compromise latency and user privacy. When creating commercial spots like the Adidas Samba sequence, the priority is eliminating AI hallucinations and delivering broadcast-quality realism.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Editorial Quote Graphic -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-8 rounded-xl border border-[#DCDCD8] dark:border-[#30302D] bg-[#0E0E10] text-white">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[#3157FF] dark:text-[#6B82FF] mb-4">CORE MOTTO</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4 leading-snug">
          "IDEAS → SYSTEMS → REAL THINGS"
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#8E8E93] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Deconstruct complexity into minimal working parts. Test assumptions with real data. Polish the sensory layer until it feels intentional.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#262628] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-[#6B6B6B]">
          <span>KANISHK ROY</span>
          <span>EST. 2024</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Principles & Selected Tools Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20">
      <!-- Working Principles -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-[#DCDCD8] dark:border-[#30302D] bg-white dark:bg-[#181818] transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-[#3157FF] dark:text-[#6B82FF] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold mb-4">
          OPERATIONAL PRINCIPLES
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-[#111111] dark:text-[#F5F5F2]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#3157FF] dark:text-[#6B82FF] font-mono font-bold">01</span>
            <span><strong>Evidence over speculation:</strong> Working prototypes and real benchmarks beat slide decks every time.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#3157FF] dark:text-[#6B82FF] font-mono font-bold">02</span>
            <span><strong>Restraint over excess:</strong> Good design knows what to omit. Avoid gratuitous animations and generic AI buzzwords.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#3157FF] dark:text-[#6B82FF] font-mono font-bold">03</span>
            <span><strong>End-to-end accountability:</strong> Take ownership from first architectural concept to post-launch optimization.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Focus & Tools -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-[#DCDCD8] dark:border-[#30302D] bg-white dark:bg-[#181818] transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-[#3157FF] dark:text-[#6B82FF] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold mb-4">
          CORE DOMAINS &amp; TOOLKIT
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[#6B6B6B] dark:text-[#A3A3A0]">
          <div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#111111] dark:text-[#F5F5F2] uppercase block mb-1">Architecture &amp; Edge</span>
            TypeScript, Cloudflare Workers, Durable Objects, WebSockets, Python, FastAPI, WebAssembly
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#111111] dark:text-[#F5F5F2] uppercase block mb-1">Creative AI &amp; Post-Production</span>
            Midjourney v6, Runway Gen-3, Kling AI, Premiere Pro, CapCut, Foley Sound Mix
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#111111] dark:text-[#F5F5F2] uppercase block mb-1">Interface &amp; Product Design</span>
            Astro, React 19, Tailwind CSS, Figma, Accessibility (WCAG), Responsive Typography
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact CTA -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0E0E10] border border-[#262628] text-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Have a project in mind?</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#8E8E93]">Open for Q4 product engineering, AI pipeline design, and creative direction.</p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#3157FF] dark:bg-[#6B82FF] text-white dark:text-[#111111] text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-[#2143E0] dark:hover:bg-[#8EA0FF] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-xs"
      >
        Get in touch →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
